        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/a183cd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-29T21:49:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What does the text, \"the first time...\" mean? I didn't really understand it before the expansion but with the Ennead based around that text I thought I should learn. Does that mean the effect of the text only gets played once and then is done because that was the first time?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:18.685Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
